"Copy of my authority letter is Ex. R3W1/1; Insurance policy filed in the DAR which is already Ex. PW-1/2(colly);
Attested copy of Insurance policy is Ex. R3W1/2; Copy of notice dated 15.08.2025 is Ex. R3W1/3; Postal receipts are Ex. R3W1/4."
